@startuml
title Main data relationships - learning map
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle Season
rectangle SeasonSport
rectangle SeasonSportDivision
rectangle SeasonTeam
rectangle Roster
rectangle "Player profile" as Player
rectangle SeasonPlayerEligibility
rectangle Game
rectangle "Singleton ScheduleLock" as ScheduleLock
Season --> SeasonSport
SeasonSport --> SeasonSportDivision
SeasonSportDivision --> SeasonTeam
SeasonTeam --> Roster
Player --> Roster
Season --> SeasonPlayerEligibility
Player --> SeasonPlayerEligibility
SeasonSportDivision --> Game
SeasonTeam --> Game : home team
SeasonTeam --> Game : away team
ScheduleLock --> Game : serializes schedule writes
note bottom
  This is a learning map, not a complete ER diagram.
  Removing a roster entry does not delete the player.
end note
@enduml
